id=xiaomi_usb_sec_bypass
name=Xiaomi USB Security Bypass
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=CHERWIN
description=Enable "USB debugging (Security settings)" / "USB install" / fastboot on rooted MIUI without Mi account & SIM. Sets persist.security.adbinstall, persist.security.adbinput, persist.fastboot.enable to 1 on every boot so scrcpy/Total Control etc. can inject input.
